text-to-svg-cli

This is just a small CLI wrapper around https://www.npmjs.com/package/text-to-svg

Install:

    npm install text-to-svg-cli -g

Usage:

    text-to-svg-cli --config=config.json

Config file format:

    {
        "text": "Logo",
        "font": "./Origami-Mommy-Pixellated.ttf",
        "save_path": "./test.svg",
        "options": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "fontSize": 200,
            "anchor": "top",
            "letterSpacing": "0.5",
            "attributes": {
                "fill": "#1c76c5",
                "stroke": "#41adff"
            }
        }
    }

License

MIT © Dennis Iversen

